    3. load_library with a bare filename ->
        RESULT AddScalarPlugin.so     -> NoneType   AddScalar registered: False
        RESULT ./AddScalarPlugin.so   -> PyCapsule  AddScalar registered: True
        `load_library` returns None and raises nothing. The parser then reports
        `Plugin not found, are the plugin name, version, and namespace correct?`,
        which points at three things that are all fine.
